        586.6614173228347
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 34.6,
      "text": "Around midday it ______ its jaws on a major vein underneath a leaf, about 25 centimetres above the ground."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        524.7614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        542.0614173228347
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 17.3,
      "text": "When researchers moved infected ants higher, the fungus grew ______."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        497.46141732283473,
        461.8976377952756,
        514.7614173228347
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 17.3,
      "text": "Yet the fungus had not ______ the brain."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        470.1614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        487.46141732283473
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 17.3,
      "text": "The ______ scenario gave gamers a fictional nightmare."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        378.76141732283475,
        461.8976377952756,
        410.1614173228347
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "感染  泰国木匠蚁感染偏侧蛇虫草菌后离群，正午咬住离地约25厘米的叶背主脉，黄昏死去。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        340.36141732283477,
        461.8976377952756,
        371.76141732283475
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "传播  真菌破坏颚肌，使蚂蚁死后仍咬紧；两三天后菌柄顶出，孢子散向下方蚂蚁觅食的地面。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        301.9614173228348,
        461.8976377952756,
        333.36141732283477
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "选址  咬痕多在温湿度适合的植物西北侧；感染蚂蚁移高后真菌生长反常，放到地面的蚁尸则消失。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        279.2614173228348,
        461.8976377952756,
        294.9614173228348
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 15.7,
      "text": "成像  2017年三维成像发现，真菌在腿、颚肌肉周围织成网络，却没有侵入蚂蚁大脑。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        240.8614173228348,
        461.8976377952756,
        272.2614173228348
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "边界  4800万年前的叶化石已有同类咬痕；纪录片启发了游戏《最后生还者》，但感染人类的情节是虚构。"
    },
